{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05856","headline":"送綦毋秘书弃官还江东 · 王维","name":"送綦毋秘书弃官还江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明时久不达，弃置与君同。\n天命无怨色，人生有素风。\n念君拂衣去，四海将安穷。\n秋天万里净，日暮澄江空。\n清夜何悠悠，扣舷明月中。\n和光鱼鸟际，澹尔蒹葭丛。\n无庸客昭世，衰鬓日如蓬。\n顽疎暗人事，僻陋远天聪。\n微物纵可采，其谁爲至公。\n余亦从此去，归耕爲老农。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}